{
  "bvid": "BV1tytqe1EEs",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "42f4bc9d34d70d2845374db83a56ad642705d4b0be5eccdd6f464d3b1362e100",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 960,
      "text": "如果还要"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 960,
      "end_ms": 3080,
      "text": "而且我我说的再难听点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 3080,
      "end_ms": 6730,
      "text": "就是这个社会权利意义上的力量对比"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 6730,
      "end_ms": 7850,
      "text": "不发生扭转的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 7850,
      "end_ms": 10100,
      "text": "只是发钱的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 10100,
      "end_ms": 11200,
      "text": "就在那说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 11200,
      "end_ms": 13400,
      "text": "你发下去立刻就就回去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 13400,
      "end_ms": 15300,
      "text": "就是个结构不发生变化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 15300,
      "end_ms": 17580,
      "text": "你注的水越多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 18020,
      "end_ms": 19720,
      "text": "两极分化的程度越大"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 19720,
      "end_ms": 22020,
      "text": "而且通胀起来了之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 22020,
      "end_ms": 25380,
      "text": "你给所有人发一块钱有啥用"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 25710,
      "end_ms": 27850,
      "text": "你如果给所有人发100块钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 27850,
      "end_ms": 29530,
      "text": "然后通胀起来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 29530,
      "end_ms": 31910,
      "text": "通胀起来了之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 32390,
      "end_ms": 36950,
      "text": "那最后穷人户头上的1万块钱也不值钱了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 36950,
      "end_ms": 43630,
      "text": "大灌水一定会就是这种这样给是一定要通胀的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 43630,
      "end_ms": 45970,
      "text": "通胀后面一定是穷人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 45970,
      "end_ms": 47230,
      "text": "是死翘翘的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 49380,
      "end_ms": 50320,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 50320,
      "end_ms": 55470,
      "text": "就是你穷人的钱就只只能去购买消费品了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 55470,
      "end_ms": 57710,
      "text": "所谓的引发通胀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 57710,
      "end_ms": 62030,
      "text": "就意味着说资产阶级整个的对于劳工阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 62030,
      "end_ms": 66880,
      "text": "底层无产阶级缴械就对你货币除权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 68480,
      "end_ms": 70070,
      "text": "通胀就是这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 70070,
      "end_ms": 71830,
      "text": "你没有办法再用"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 71830,
      "end_ms": 75870,
      "text": "通过货币的形式来掌控小规模的生产资料的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 75870,
      "end_ms": 78230,
      "text": "一点都不行啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 78550,
      "end_ms": 80950,
      "text": "所有的生产资料收归资产业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 80950,
      "end_ms": 83590,
      "text": "所有大通胀来的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 84570,
      "end_ms": 87430,
      "text": "然后你的钱只够买消费品"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 87430,
      "end_ms": 88510,
      "text": "甚至还不太够"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 88510,
      "end_ms": 89070,
      "text": "越来越不够"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 89070,
      "end_ms": 89790,
      "text": "越来越不够"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 89790,
      "end_ms": 94470,
      "text": "然后逼着你最后重新去投靠资产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 94950,
      "end_ms": 97190,
      "text": "通胀大通胀有这么一个作用啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 97190,
      "end_ms": 99550,
      "text": "我不认为他一定会引发系统性危机"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 99550,
      "end_ms": 100740,
      "text": "然后是革命啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 100740,
      "end_ms": 101500,
      "text": "通胀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 101500,
      "end_ms": 102500,
      "text": "大规模通胀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 102500,
      "end_ms": 104700,
      "text": "有的时候是逐步的对你进行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 104700,
      "end_ms": 106180,
      "text": "生产资料方面的除权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 106180,
      "end_ms": 108060,
      "text": "你的钱没有办法去控制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 108060,
      "end_ms": 110220,
      "text": "控制这个生产资料的购置"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 110220,
      "end_ms": 112840,
      "text": "生产资料不要想了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 116860,
      "end_ms": 117660,
      "text": "还有一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 117660,
      "end_ms": 122220,
      "text": "就是说你根本的对于社会权力的控制的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 122220,
      "end_ms": 124280,
      "text": "那个力量对比没有发生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 124280,
      "end_ms": 127760,
      "text": "也就是说根本对于整个社会生产资料的控制的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 127760,
      "end_ms": 130320,
      "text": "控制力的关系没有发生扭转的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 130320,
      "end_ms": 133270,
      "text": "你硬再多的钱没有意义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 133270,
      "end_ms": 134410,
      "text": "印再多的钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 134410,
      "end_ms": 136540,
      "text": "因为你印的那些钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 136900,
      "end_ms": 142300,
      "text": "然后呢就是一它会推推着生产资料的价格上升"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 142869,
      "end_ms": 144409,
      "text": "是买不起的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 144409,
      "end_ms": 146949,
      "text": "其次他也会就是穷人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 146949,
      "end_ms": 149420,
      "text": "只会用这个东西来买消费品"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 149420,
      "end_ms": 152100,
      "text": "我觉得最简单的方式就是给消费品"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 153420,
      "end_ms": 157030,
      "text": "就是就是提供基本消费品保障"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 157030,
      "end_ms": 158770,
      "text": "给钱没用的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 158770,
      "end_ms": 160930,
      "text": "给钱没有用的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 160930,
      "end_ms": 163510,
      "text": "然后呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 164840,
      "end_ms": 167000,
      "text": "然后你给消费品又又搞不定啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 167000,
      "end_ms": 170170,
      "text": "你给消费品必须要有提供消费品的渠道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 170170,
      "end_ms": 172010,
      "text": "如果提供消费品的渠道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 172010,
      "end_ms": 174710,
      "text": "又是操纵在这个资产阶手上的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 174710,
      "end_ms": 179600,
      "text": "那就是力量对比更更不平均更不平等了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 179600,
      "end_ms": 180800,
      "text": "那有的无产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 180800,
      "end_ms": 183740,
      "text": "可能他无产阶级团体或者他的个体户啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 183740,
      "end_ms": 185460,
      "text": "他底层互保性质的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 185460,
      "end_ms": 189630,
      "text": "它有一些小的餐饮业啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 189630,
      "end_ms": 191930,
      "text": "有的这种食品供应链农业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 191930,
      "end_ms": 193600,
      "text": "这不被卷死啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 193600,
      "end_ms": 196300,
      "text": "他有个由头来用更多的油"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 196300,
      "end_ms": 198290,
      "text": "这个既得利益者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 198290,
      "end_ms": 199090,
      "text": "胜利者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 199090,
      "end_ms": 200090,
      "text": "资产阶级的力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 200090,
      "end_ms": 204110,
      "text": "去取代你的这个食品保供体系呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 204110,
      "end_ms": 205330,
      "text": "这两口子收的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 205330,
      "end_ms": 210180,
      "text": "都会自然自己也知道放这两口子啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 210180,
      "end_ms": 213940,
      "text": "消费品的这个这个投放"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 213940,
      "end_ms": 216120,
      "text": "如果是搞一个无差别的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 216120,
      "end_ms": 218500,
      "text": "基本消费品的一个保障投放"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 218500,
      "end_ms": 220480,
      "text": "那那更不好搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 220480,
      "end_ms": 224680,
      "text": "然后呃还或者说直接给钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 224680,
      "end_ms": 226100,
      "text": "那也不好搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 226100,
      "end_ms": 228840,
      "text": "这两个资产阶都不会选啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 228840,
      "end_ms": 229900,
      "text": "他不蠢的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 229900,
      "end_ms": 234280,
      "text": "然后还有一个就是呃他不他不选的原因"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 234280,
      "end_ms": 237220,
      "text": "不是说他不满足他的短期利益"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 237220,
      "end_ms": 238540,
      "text": "选这两项"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 238540,
      "end_ms": 239900,
      "text": "比如直接发钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 239900,
      "end_ms": 245340,
      "text": "或者说比如说这个我们再说说难听点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 245340,
      "end_ms": 245980,
      "text": "比如香港"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 245980,
      "end_ms": 250030,
      "text": "香港的就是资方和这个和这个劳方的关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 250030,
      "end_ms": 253090,
      "text": "阶级矛盾是比我们这个内地啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 253090,
      "end_ms": 253810,
      "text": "用内地啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 253810,
      "end_ms": 255880,
      "text": "香港是中国的一部分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 255880,
      "end_ms": 259820,
      "text": "比内地是更那个的就更尖锐"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 259820,
      "end_ms": 261160,
      "text": "要不他更买不起房"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 261160,
      "end_ms": 265940,
      "text": "他那个居住就是购购置资产的那个更难"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 265940,
      "end_ms": 269170,
      "text": "虽然他那个薪资收入也还可以"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 269170,
      "end_ms": 271890,
      "text": "薪资收入像好像比深圳什么还好一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 271890,
      "end_ms": 272930,
      "text": "但是他又买一房"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 272930,
      "end_ms": 275700,
      "text": "就这住的很小很小的屋子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 275700,
      "end_ms": 279340,
      "text": "然后他的那些稍微有点生产资料支配权的岗位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 279340,
      "end_ms": 280680,
      "text": "是被垄断的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 280680,
      "end_ms": 283140,
      "text": "绝对垄断的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 283900,
      "end_ms": 284960,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 284960,
      "end_ms": 287980,
      "text": "然后我立即更正了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 287980,
      "end_ms": 288540,
      "text": "没问题的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 288540,
      "end_ms": 290380,
      "text": "这只是口误额"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 290380,
      "end_ms": 292309,
      "text": "还有一点是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 295220,
      "end_ms": 296780,
      "text": "所以他会发钱啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 296780,
      "end_ms": 298100,
      "text": "所以他会发钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 298100,
      "end_ms": 299540,
      "text": "因为他知道这个钱发下去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 299540,
      "end_ms": 300950,
      "text": "你一下子就没有了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 300950,
      "end_ms": 305190,
      "text": "这个我说的发起直接发现金这件事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 305190,
      "end_ms": 307950,
      "text": "就是说现金发下去了之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 307950,
      "end_ms": 309950,
      "text": "无人机没有办法把这个现金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 309950,
      "end_ms": 312420,
      "text": "变成他对生产资料的控制权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 312420,
      "end_ms": 316400,
      "text": "资产阶级反倒是会把发给无产阶级的钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 316400,
      "end_ms": 320710,
      "text": "通过消费的层面收上来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 320710,
      "end_ms": 324310,
      "text": "那它相比于无产阶级手上控制着的那些"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 325470,
      "end_ms": 328040,
      "text": "就是那些生产资料"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 328040,
      "end_ms": 331060,
      "text": "就是归根结底这是一个掌握生产资料的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 331060,
      "end_ms": 331860,
      "text": "我说的难听点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 331860,
      "end_ms": 334620,
      "text": "你有本事给无产阶级发生产资料"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 334740,
      "end_ms": 336760,
      "text": "发你妈钱算什么本事啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 336760,
      "end_ms": 340960,
      "text": "呵是不是发钱发消费品"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 340960,
      "end_ms": 341920,
      "text": "这都没用的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 341920,
      "end_ms": 344360,
